\par\par \b \uc2 POLL-Swedish crown expected to defying  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  and gain against euro\b0\par\par\uc2 492 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Januar 2016\par 13:20\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2016 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved.   \par \par \uc2 * For Swedish crown: reuters://realtime/verb=Open/url=cpurl://apps.cp./Apps/\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 -polls?RIC=SEK=\par \par \uc2 * For Norwegian crown: reuters://realtime/verb=Open/url=cpurl://apps.cp./Apps/\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 -polls?RIC=NOK=\par \par \uc2 * Swedish crown seen stronger vs euro despite \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  threat\par \par \uc2 * Norwegian crown seen rallying after weak 2015\par \par \uc2 By Terje Solsvik and Camilla Knudsen\par \par \uc2 OSLO, Jan 7 (Reuters) - Sweden's crown \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  will probably strengthen against the euro in 2016 despite a plan by the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken it, and its gains are likely to be accompanied by a rally in the Norwegian crown, according to a Reuters poll.\par \par \uc2 Sweden's consumer prices have been flat or falling for most of the last three years even though its economy is growing. A meagre pickup in prices towards the end of 2015 seems to have stalled, in part because of the crown's recent strength.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's board, which has slashed interest rates to a record low of minus 0.35 percent, earlier this week authorised its governor to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to push down the crown in a bid to boost inflation.\par \par \uc2 But market strategists expect the crown, which has risen by about three percent against the euro since September, to gain another three percent in 2016 to reach 9.00 by the end of the year.\par \par \uc2 "Sweden is now among the top international performers in terms of economic growth, making the crown attractive," DNB Markets economist Camilla Viland said. "We believe the crown will remain so even though the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is clearly trying to limit the attraction by threatening to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ."\par \par \uc2 DNB also predicted that \b \highlight22\uc2 Sweden\b0 \highlight\uc2 's inflation rate will rise in 2016, reducing the need for a weaker \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Viland said.\par \par \uc2 NOK TO REBOUND DESPITE OIL INDUSTRY WEAKNESS\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  of neighbouring Norway has weakened, falling around 13 percent to 9.65 against the euro since May as the price of crude oil, Norway's key export, continues to decline. But it is expected to rise by seven percent during the next 12 months to reach 8.95.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Norwegian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which itself has forecast a somewhat stronger crown, wants to avoid a surge that could hurt the economy at a vulnerable time and has said it is likely to cut rates in March.\par \par \uc2 Forecasts varied a great deal for both the Swedish and the Norwegian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , reflecting differing views among analysts on factors ranging from global growth and interest rates to the price of oil.\par \par \uc2 The most bearish predicted that both \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  will weaken by over three percent against the euro by the end of 2016. The most bullish expect rallies of around 11 percent.\par \par \uc2 (Other stories from the global \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  poll: )\par \par \uc2 (Other news articles on Reuters polls: [POLL/) (Polling by Siddharth Iyer and Kailash Bathija; Editing by Ross Finley and Larry King)\par \par \uc2 Released: 2016-1-10T12:20:31.000Z   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020160107ec1700ew6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
