\par\par \b \uc2 Swedish c.bankers say  \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention \highlight\uc2  very unlikely\b0\par\par\uc2 240 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 September 2012\par 10:21\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2  STOCKHOLM, Sept 18 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Sweden\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is very unlikely to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to steer the level of the Nordic country's record-strong \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , two of the bank's six governors said on Tuesday.\par \par \uc2  The Swedish crown hit a 12-year high against the euro in August and despite easing over the last month remains at levels not seen since late 2001, causing problems for some of Sweden's export companies.\par \par \uc2  "The way that the crown and the crown movements affect us in our monetary policy decisions is the effect on inflation and resource utilisation," Deputy Riksbank Governor Karolina Ekholm said in a parliamentary hearing.\par \par \uc2  Ekholm said should the crown strengthen so much as to risk creating deflation, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would adjust the repo rate to encourage a rise in prices.\par \par \uc2  "That the Riksbank would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to bring down the level of the crown, that, I think is extremely unlikely."\par \par \uc2  Governor Stefan Ingves, giving testimony to parliament alongside Ekholm, said he seconded that comment and noted there was "very little" chance the Riksbank would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.\par \par \uc2  Ingves also noted that the recent strength of the crown \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2   was not exceptional in historic terms and was natural in a situation with robust \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  account surpluses. \par \par \uc2 SWEDEN-CBANK/CROWN(URGENT) | ABN | D | DA | E | RBN | FN | M | NW | SW | RNP | DNP | PTD   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020120918e89i000ed\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
