\par\par \b \uc2  Swedish Riksbank to publish  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  details. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Peter Starck \par \uc2 557 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Februar 2002\par 14:25\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  STOCKHOLM, Feb 6 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Sweden\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Riksbank, proclaiming greater openness than other central banks, said on Wednesday it will publish regular details of any \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in future, formalising a practice introduced last summer. \par \par \uc2  The Riksbank's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy may become the focus of market scrutiny if Swedes vote in favour of joining Europe's monetary union and their now freely floating crown is linked to the ERM-2 exchange rate grid. \par \par \uc2  Once in ERM-2 the crown would be kept in a tight fluctuation band, if necessary through \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  action. \par \par \uc2  The Riksbank, which dating from the mid-17th century is the world's oldest \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , said its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  information policy entailed "much greater transparency" than is common among central banks. \par \par \uc2  "It is important that the bases for all decisions, including those on \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , are reported in an open and clear manner," it said. \par \par \uc2  The Swedish government has hinted at plans to hold a referendum on euro membership next year. According to a tentative timetable unveiled by Prime Minister Goran Persson last month, the crown might then enter ERM-2 in February 2004. \par \par \uc2  The Riksbank came under fire last summer when it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  repeatedly, attempting to shore up the then steadily weakening crown. \par \par \uc2  The crown has been floating since the early 1990s and the Riksbank's main monetary policy objective is to keep inflation at on average two percent. Last summer the Riksbank said the softening crown posed a latent threat to its inflation target. \par \par \uc2  "\b \highlight22\uc2 Interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market are primarily a means of signalling and emphasising changes in monetary policy; a process that is necessary to maintain price stability," the Riksbank said on Wednesday. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  might be used selectively for other economic policy purposes as well, including "to influence the exchange rate or to promote the efficient functioning of the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market," it said. \par \par \uc2  FIVE PERCENT UPSIDE \par \par \uc2  According to the consensus forecast in a recent Reuters poll of economists, the Swedish unit would enter ERM-2 at a central parity rate of 8.70 crowns per euro, or over five percent stronger than its present level around 9.20 . \par \par \uc2  "\b \highlight22\uc2 Interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue to be used with restraint," the Riksbank said, adding its monetary policy-making board had decided at a meeting on January 31 that two separate decisions would be taken in conjunction with any \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  One would be "an outline of the motives behind \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 ", the other "a nominal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  mandate", the latter spelling out how much of the bank's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves could be committed in an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Riksbank board adviser Anders Borg told Reuters. \par \par \uc2  The main elements in the outline of motives will normally be published in a press release, the bank said. \par \par \uc2  Borg said the press release would be published in connection with the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  but there was no fixed procedure determining when such a press release would be issued. \par \par \uc2  "The considerations with regard to motives for \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  will be reported in separate minutes, which will normally be published with some time lag," the Riksbank said. \par \par \uc2  Decisions on the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  mandate, which would also usually include the time period during which the \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  could be made, would be recorded in separate minutes. These would not be published if that would be counter-productive, it said. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020206dy2600qf6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
