\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Sweden \highlight\uc2  Riksbank Minutes: Future  \highlight22\uc2 Interventions \highlight\uc2  Possible \b0\par\par\uc2 466 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 November 2001\par 11:40\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2001, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  STOCKHOLM -(Dow Jones)- Lars Heikensten, first deputy governor of Sweden's Riksbank, concluded at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Nov. 8 executive board meeting that it is possible  the Riksbank may \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market again. \par \par \uc2  The minutes of that meeting, published Friday, revealed that all board members supported his conclusions, of which future possible \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was one feature. \par \par \uc2  Heikensten said that, normally, \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  are made as a part of monetary policy and are aimed at safeguarding the inflation target. However, one can't rule out the possibility that other situations could arise where \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  may be motivated. It should always be possible to provide clear motives for such decisions, he added. \par \par \uc2  "\b \highlight22\uc2 Interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  are an instrument that will be used with great caution, as long as the floating exchange rate regime prevails," Heikensten said. \par \par \uc2  Normally, monetary policy is implemented through adjustments to the steering interest rates. \par \par \uc2  Situations where \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  are necessary are rarely obvious from a decision-making perspective, he said. It is therefore possible to have differing opinions within the executive board when making decisions on \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Heikensten said the process for drafting and making decisions on \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  should be as open and clear as possible. \par \par \uc2  "This should be the starting point for proposals put to the executive board on procedures and communication, etc. regarding \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," he said. \par \par \uc2  The discussion followed the Riksbank's series of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in July, when it sold euros to the value of SEK12 billion. \par \par \uc2  Although the Riksbank carried out the \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  as part of its monetary policy, aimed at safeguarding price stability in line with the inflation target one to two years ahead, some uncertainty arose on the financial markets, as well as criticism among economists and other market participants. \par \par \uc2  The minutes of the Nov. 8 meeting stated that the Riksbank's credibility wasn't negatively affected by the \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , when one considers the concept of credibility to refer to the inflation target and whether the measures taken contributed to achieving this or not. \par \par \uc2  "Following the \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  there were no clear signs of rising inflation, higher inflation expectations or increased long-term interest rate differentials in relation to other countries. Nor has the depreciation of the krona accelerated, rather the reverse. This indicates that the credibility of the inflation target has certainly not been affected negatively," the minutes said. \par \par \uc2  The Riksbank minutes noted also that many analysts, both market participants and academic research economists, have been critical of the measures taken and that this criticism has remained for longer than it did, for instance, after the Riksbank's last \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in 1998. \par \par \uc2  Riksbank Web site: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.riksbank.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.riksbank.com}}}\par \par \uc2  -By Rupini Bergstrom, Dow Jones Newswires; +46 8 5451 3092; rupini.bergstrom@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  4302 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011130dxbu000q2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
