\par\par \b \uc2  Swedish c.banker casts doubts over crown defence. \b0\par\par\uc2 253 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 September 2001\par 10:13\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  STOCKHOLM, Sept 4 (Reuters) - Monetary policy alone is not enough to quench big financial market swings, a board member of \b \highlight22\uc2 Sweden\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which has recently \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  and raised key interest rates to prop up the ailing crown, said on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Eva Srejber, second deputy governor of the Riksbank and a member of its monetary-policy-setting executive board, said she did not believe "that monetary policy alone can counteract exaggerated movements in the financial markets". \par \par \uc2  Citing budding inflationary pressures from what it described at the time as an excessively weak crown exchange rate, the Riksbank \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets in June buying crowns against the euro and the dollar . \par \par \uc2  In July Sweden's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which targets inflation of on average two percent over a business cycle, tightened monetary policy and justified the move by saying the persistently weak crown could pose a threat to the inflation target. \par \par \uc2  Measured by a trade-weighted \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket index , the crown stood at 139.70 at 0745 GMT, just off all-time lows of 139.99 set on Monday but around one percent softer than in early July when the Riksbank raised its repo rate and in mid-June when the bank \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prop up the crown. \par \par \uc2  "A clear monetary policy aimed at price stability is necessary in the work on maintaining financial stability," Srejber said in the text of a prepared speech, which did not mention the Riksbank's actions regarding the crown. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010904dx9400gtq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
