\par\par \b \uc2  Swedish c.bank says has not  \highlight22\uc2 intervened \highlight\uc2  in  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 185 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Juni 2001\par 13:59\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  STOCKHOLM, June 21 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Sweden\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Riksbank \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it had not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Thursday after the crown spiked sharply against the euro and the dollar. \par \par \uc2  "We have not been into the market today," Riksbank spokesman Thomas Thyblad said. \par \par \uc2  The Riksbank had previously \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Friday and Monday to support the domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which it regards as distinctly undervalued. \par \par \uc2  On Friday it said the strategy was a monetary policy action to combat the inflationary impact of an excessively weak \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Riksbank Governor Urban Backstrom said on Saturday he believed the crown's weakening by double-digit percentage figures against the euro and the dollar in the past year, a trend which has recently accelerated, was due largely to a market psychology, which he likened to the boom and bust in information technology shares in 1999-2000. \par \par \uc2  "This can feed on itself and that's why we wanted to enter the market with full strength and send a signal that this is wrong," he said in an interview on Swedish radio news. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010712dx6l00z0j\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
