\par\par \b \uc2  UPDATE 3-Swedish c.bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  beefs up crown. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Peter Starck \par \uc2 833 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Juni 2001\par 18:57\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  STOCKHOLM, June 15 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Sweden\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the Riksbank, \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  repeatedly in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets on Friday to support the domestic crown \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and stave off a growing inflationary threat. \par \par \uc2  The crown jumped against both the dollar and the euro and was holding near two-week highs by 1600 GMT, though slightly off intra-day peaks corresponding to gains of 1.5 percent and 1.1 percent against the dollar and the euro respectively. \par \par \uc2  But despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's advance analysts said the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , a rare move these days by central banks targeting inflation rather than exchange rates, may not achieve its purpose unless backed up by a rise in key interest rates. \par \par \uc2  "In this environment the probability of a hike in the near term increases very substantially," UBS Warburg analyst Guillaume Salomon said in a research note. \par \par \uc2  Swedish Finance Minister Bosse Ringholm said he hoped the \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  would be successful. \par \par \uc2  But Ringholm, current chairman of the European Union's Ecofin grouping of finance ministers, said he believed the Riksbank's move was not intended as a signal to the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (ECB) to act in a similar way to support the weak euro. \par \par \uc2  "It is up to the Riksbank to decide about such things... but of course when the Riksbank makes these \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  the government is hoping that it will be successful," Ringholm told reporters after an Ecofin meeting during a summit of EU leaders in Gothenburg in south-western Sweden. \par \par \uc2  Sweden is not a member of the euro single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  POLICY REVIEW ON JULY 5 \par \par \uc2  The Riksbank said in a statement it had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  "with a view to strengthening the Swedish crown" but declined to comment on levels or \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold. \par \par \uc2  "The Riksbank will make a complete assessment of inflation and the consequences for monetary policy at the Executive Board meeting on 5 July,", the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said. \par \par \uc2  Swedish short-term market interest rates spiked up as investors began discounting a monetary tightening. The benchmark six-month maturity jumped 13 basis points to 4.30 percent. \par \par \uc2  "They (the Riksbank) could do without the interest rate gap against the ECB," Aisling Freiheit-Kinch, an analyst at Morgan Stanley in New York, told Reuters. \par \par \uc2  "The question is now are they willing to back it up with interest rate hikes?" \par \par \uc2  She said the 50 basis point differential between the Riksbank's repo rate at 4.00 percent and the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's (ECB) main refi rate at 4.50 percent was one reason why funds had continued to flow out of Sweden, putting pressure on the crown. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said the Riksbank had been buying crowns against the euro at 9.19-9.21 crowns and at 10.58 crowns against the dollar during the morning session and again against the euro at 9.1250-9.1450 in the afternoon. \par \par \uc2  The euro leapt a quarter cent to new three-week highs of $0.8673 according to Reuters data, its best showing since May 22, and up more than 1/2 a cent on the day, with traders attributing the move to the talk of sales of dollars for Swedish crowns by the Riksbank. \par \par \uc2  At 1605 GMT the euro was trading at $0.8620. \par \par \uc2  ADVANCE WARNING \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Sweden\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  came one day after a warning by Urban Backstrom, the Riksbank governor, that this was a tool that could be used. \par \par \uc2  "The Riksbank warned of their intentions yesterday, so the market should not be surprised," said Steve Barrow, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at Bear Stearns in London. \par \par \uc2  "The crown's weakness is jeopardising price stability and the Riksbank is likely to keep \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  until the crown has stabilised," he added. \par \par \uc2  The Riksbank does not have an exchange rate target for the freely floating crown but has said \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is a tool at its disposal to combat inflation, which hit a six-year high of 3.0 percent in May with underlying inflation at a seven-year high of 3.1 percent, both well above the bank's two percent target. \par \par \uc2  The Riksbank said the continued depreciation of the crown was increasing the risk of inflation exceeding the target. \par \par \uc2  "The risk of inflation has grown in that the krona has continued to depreciate from levels that were already low," it said in a statement. \par \par \uc2  "At a time when the exchange rate is a serious upside risk in the inflation forecast and deviates markedly from a reasonable value, a situation may arise where \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  are motivated," Backstrom said on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The crown climbed to 10.55, its highest in two weeks against the dollar, and stood at 10.5760 at 1605 GMT. \par \par \uc2  It also firmed to 9.1250 per euro before settling back at 9.1330 at 1605 GMT. \par \par \uc2  Earlier on Friday Riksbank Deputy Governor Lars Heikensten said in a speech that long term weakness in the Swedish crown was having an impact on inflation which could prompt direct \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010712dx6f01nct\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
