\par\par \b \uc2  Swedish c.bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2  in  \highlight22\uc2 currency \highlight\uc2  market. \b0\par\par\uc2 311 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Juni 2001\par 11:48\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  STOCKHOLM, June 15 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Sweden\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the Riksbank, announced it had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Friday with a view to strengthing the Swedish crown. \par \par \uc2  The bank said the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was based on a decision taken by the Executive Board of the bank on June 14. \par \par \uc2  "One of the measures available to the Riksbank is \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 -market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," the bank said in a statement. \par \par \uc2  "This can be particularly motivated if pricing in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market deviates markedly from what can be considered fundamentally appropriate and if the price is moving away from what is fundamentally appropriate in a process that is liable to become self generating." \par \par \uc2  Traders said they believed the bank had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  at 0910 GMT at the level of 9.19 crowns to the euro. They said the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  might create short term uncertainty that would undermine the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the longer term. \par \par \uc2  "If you look at history it's seldom that you suceed in making these \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Robert Bergqvist, chief \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  analyst at SEB. \par \par \uc2  "I am quite doubtful that this \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  will be successful." \par \par \uc2  The bank said it would make a complete assessment of inflation and the consequences for monetary policy at the Eexecutive Board meetong on July 5. \par \par \uc2  Earlier on Friday the bank's Deputy Governor Lars Heikensten said in a speech that long term weakness in the Swedish crown was having an impact on inflation which could prompt direct \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Statistics \b \highlight22\uc2 Sweden\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Thursday released headline CPI numbers for May which were up 0.7 percent compared with April and up 3.0 percent year-on-year - higher than analysts had expected. \par \par \uc2  According to a Reuters poll, analysts had expected a 0.5 percent increase month-on-month and a 2.8 percent rise year-on-year. \par \par \uc2  For the Riksbank's statement on the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010712dx6f01ks9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
