\par\par \b \uc2  EU SUMMIT:  \highlight22\uc2 Sweden \highlight\uc2  PM Backs Riksbank's Krona  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 311 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Juni 2001\par 18:44\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  GOTHENBURG, \b \highlight22\uc2 Sweden\b0 \highlight\uc2  -(Dow Jones)- Swedish Prime Minister Goeran Persson said Friday that the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had his "full support" after it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the krona on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets. \par \par \uc2  "They (Swedish \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials) have my full support and I am confident about their ability," Persson told Dow Jones Newswires on the sidelines of a European Union summit meeting in Gothenburg. \par \par \uc2  Persson was responding to a question about his opinion of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  earlier Friday by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , known as the Sveriges Riksbank. \par \par \uc2  As reported, Sveriges Riksbank confirmed it bought the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and sold U.S. dollars to prevent the krona's weakness from increasing inflationary pressures. \par \par \uc2  Persson went out of his way to praise the Riksbank even though he emphasized the bank is independent by law. \par \par \uc2  "I have no influence at all on the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," he said. "I think they are capable and they are professional. They know what they do and they are using the instruments they have." \par \par \uc2  Separately Friday, Swedish Finance Minister Bosse Ringholm said he hoped the Riksbank move would be "successful." \par \par \uc2  In remarks to reporters, Ringholm also said he didn't expect the Riksbank's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to affect the likelihood of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Analysts have seen ECB \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  as likely in recent weeks as the euro's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate fell to roughly six-month lows below $0.85. \par \par \uc2  "I think that it's an independent position by the Swedish Riksbank and the ECB will take its own position," Ringholm said. "I don't think it's necessary to have any form of coordination." \par \par \uc2  In any case, analysts expressed doubts that the Riksbank \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would succeed. \par \par \uc2  -By Jonathan Stearns, Dow Jones Newswires; 49-170-220-7082; jonathan.stearns@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  (Rupini Bergstrom contributed to this story) \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010711dx6f02s29\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
