\par\par \b \uc2  FOCUS - Swedish Riksbank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2 , rescues crown. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Mariam Isa \par \uc2 566 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Oktober 1998\par 18:56\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  STOCKHOLM, Oct 7 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Sweden\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Riksbank \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market for the first time in at least a year on Wednesday, buying crowns for marks in a successful bid to stop the beleaguered \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from tracking the dollar's sharp decline. \par \par \uc2  Riksbank governor Urban Backstrom told a seminar in New York the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  because the crown's recent sharp decline was unjustified by the economy's fundamentals. \par \par \uc2  "Under these circumstances the Riksbank has chosen to use \b \highlight22\uc2 currency interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to underscore that the movements in the crown's exchange rate have been unduly abrupt and exaggerated," he said. It was the first confirmation the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Earlier, dealers said the Riksbank had bought crowns for marks several times, first at around 4.83 to the mark and later at 4.80. This halted an initial slide which took the Swedish \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to 4.9135 marks in the morning, approaching a three-year trough of 4.9420 to the mark hit on Monday. \par \par \uc2  The Riksbank has repeatedly said that the crown - which has lost more than 13 percent of its value against the mark so far this year - was undervalued. At 1640 GMT, it had weakened slightly to 4.8115 to the mark, compared with a day's trough of 4.7950 just after the latest \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Analysts said the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  made sense because the dollar hit 12-month lows against Germany's mark on Wednesday, a dive which some said could have taken the crown through the key 5.0 to the mark level. \par \par \uc2  "If there should ever be any reason for the Swedish \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  then today was the day," SE Banken strategist Georg Anderson told Reuters. \par \par \uc2  "It makes sense to break the relationship between the crown and dollar/mark because of the dollar's massive fall today - they have succeeded this time but whether they can do it again is another story," he said. \par \par \uc2  Analysts say that Sweden's economic fundamentals - which include low inflation, steady growth and gradual reduction of public debt - are solid, but the crown has been on the wrong side of recent global financial turbulence. \par \par \uc2  As long as investors remain frightened, they would sell against core European assets, which are protected by the onset of European economic and monetary union, economists say. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  needs to be more vigilant now and this is probably an early example - the only thing that worries me is that unless one thinks that global delirium has come to an end - this is just one round of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Anderson said. \par \par \uc2  Economists say that that rate hikes in Denmark and Norway earlier this year were prompted by the failure of those countries' central banks to stem \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  declines with \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Backstrom noted that if the crown's exchange rate remained weak, inflation pressure could be generated which might affect the future path of monetary policy. \par \par \uc2  The Riksbank's inflation report published last week assumed that the repo rate, Sweden's main interest rate, would remain unchanged, he said. \par \par \uc2  "As the Swedish crown is judged to be undervalued at present, we also assume that the exchange rate follows a path that represents a gradual appreciation," he said. ((Stockholm newsroom, +46-8-700 1000, fax +46-8-211601, stockholm.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021113dua701hbz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
