\par\par \b \uc2  Swedish Riksbank confirms crown  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 228 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Oktober 1998\par 18:44\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  STOCKHOLM, Oct 7 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Sweden\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the Riksbank, is \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the crown because its recent sharp fall is unjustified, Riksbank governor Urban Backstrom said on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  "The recent path of the Swedish krona is not consistent with the development of our economy's fundamentals," he said in a speech prepared for delivery in New York. "Under these circumstances the Riksbank has chosen to use \b \highlight22\uc2 currency interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to underscore that the movements in the krona's exchange rate have been unduly abrupt and exaggerated." \par \par \uc2  Earlier dealers said the Riksbank had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  repeatedly to buy the crown against the mark. \par \par \uc2  Backstrom, who said inflation would remain low in the years ahead, said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would adjust monetary policy if it believed inflation in one to two years would either undershoot or overshoot the target of two percent. \par \par \uc2  He said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  assumed inflation would be somewhat below the target in one to two years time but still approximately two percent at the end of the period. \par \par \uc2  Backstrom noted that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's quarterly inflation report issued last month judged the crown to be undervalued at present and assumes the exchange rate will gradually appreciate. \par \par \uc2  ((Paul de Bendern, Stockholm newsroom, +46-8-700 1006, fax +46-8-211601, \par \par \uc2  stockholm.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021113dua701gsi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
