\par\par \b \uc2  Swedish Riksbank Buys Kronor -2: Move Boosts Krona \b0\par\par\uc2 245 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Oktober 1998\par 14:22\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  STOCKHOLM (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Sweden\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the Riksbank, \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market early Wednesday afternoon, buying kronor against the Deutsche mark around SEK4.8300, the head of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading at a Stockholm bank said. \par \par \uc2  The purchases came as the krona was already in a strengthening trend and helped to accelerate that move, the head trader said. \par \par \uc2  Following the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the krona bounced to around SEK4.7925 against the mark, but has since retreated slightly to SEK4.8175, where it traded at 1205 GMT. \par \par \uc2  So far Wednesday, the krona has strengthened from SEK4.9200 early in the session and from SEK4.8890 late in European trading Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The trader added that the timing of the move was good since a lot of uncertainty had been removed from the market with the government's policy declaration for the coming mandate period on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2    In the document, Prime Minister Goeran Persson stressed that Sweden will keep its current economic course and said the target to have a budget surplus of 2% of gross domestic product over a full business cycle will remain. He added that the current spending ceilings won't be altered and that policy will be geared toward keeping inflation low. \par \par \uc2  The Riksbank has a policy never to comment on \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  unless they are concerted actions with more countries taking part. \par \par \uc2  -By Anette Jonsson; +46 8 5451 3093 \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 07-10-98 \par \par \uc2  1222GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010920dua7004cb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
