\par\par \b \uc2  Nordic  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2 : Sweden's Krona Up Vs DM After Overnight Dip \b0\par\par\uc2 233 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Februar 1997\par 09:46\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  STOCKHOLM (AP-Dow Jones)--Though the Swedish krona has rebounded from an overnight low against the Deutsche mark, Stockholm dealers say the pressure for further weakening of the Swedish unit remains. \par \par \uc2  'The krona can only be described as volatile and it's futile to suggest a trading range in a situation like this,' said the chief \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  analyst with a big Swedish bank. \par \par \uc2  At 0835 GMT the Deutsche mark is being quoted at 4.4745 kronor, little changed from 4.4755 late Wednesday in Europe but well down from the 4.4900 kronor price achieved overnight in Asian trade. \par \par \uc2  The Riksbank, \b \highlight22\uc2 Sweden\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market Wednesday, and dealers said it's likely to step in again Thursday to stabilize the krona should it fall too far too fast. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, no important Swedish economic indicator releases are scheduled this session so peace will reign on that front. And though the Riksbank is holding a council meeting, dealers say the weakness of the krona rules out an interest rate adjustment. \par \par \uc2  But players will be keen to hear what prime minister Goeran Persson has to say at an afternoon conference in Sweden. 'We'll have our antenna out for any mention of the costs of dismantling nuclear plants,' said one dealer. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 06-02-97 \par \par \uc2  0846GMT \par \par \uc2  1058 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt2600sup\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich2