\par\par \b \uc2  Nordic  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2 : Sweden's Krona Steadier; Calm After Early Dip \b0\par\par\uc2 276 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Februar 1997\par 13:45\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  OSLO (AP-Dow Jones)--The Swedish krona is holding steady against the Deutsche mark in calmer trade early afternoon Wednesday in Europe, after a nervous, weakening bout early in the morning. \par \par \uc2  At 1230 GMT, the Deutsche mark traded in the spot market at 4.4765 kronor, little changed from 4.4700 kronor earlier in the day, but up from 4.4525 kronor late Tuesday in Europe, and sharply higher compared with 4.4165 kronor late Friday last week. \par \par \uc2  Stockholm traders said, sentiment for the krona, which was already negative following recent worries about the Swedish Government's fiscal and energy policy, took a turn for the worse on news of a possible delayed entry for Italy into Europe's economic and monetary union. \par \par \uc2  Stockholm dealers also said the Riksbank, \b \highlight22\uc2 Sweden\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  earlier in the European session supporting the krona at around the 4.4700 kronor per mark level in small amounts to slow the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's decline. \par \par \uc2  'The Riksbank wasn't defending any particular levels for the krona,' said a dealer with a major Swedish bank, adding 'It was in the market to dampen volatility, which it succeeded in doing.' \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, looking ahead, dealers say trading will remain relatively subdued until the conclusion of the two-day U.S. Federal Reserve Open Market Committee meeting which ends Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  For the remainder of the European trading session, dealers expect the Swedish unit to stick in a range between 4.4650 kronor a mark and 4.4850 kronor a mark. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 05-02-97 \par \par \uc2  1245GMT \par \par \uc2  1058 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt2500vx3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
