\par\par \b \uc2  Riksbank interevenes to support crown - dealers. \b0\par\par\uc2 118 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Oktober 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  STOCKHOLM, Oct 29 (Reuter) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Sweden\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the Riksbank, \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in support of the crown during the morning trading session, dealers said on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The Riksbank declined to comment. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the bank had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  at 4.35 versus the mark. The crown slipped steadily throughout the morning from its late Monday fix of 4.3260. \par \par \uc2  At 1220 GTM, the crown was trading at 4.3470. \par \par \uc2  The Riksbank has said it would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to stabilise the crown, although it declined to specify whether or not it had a pre-determined target level. \par \par \uc2  -- Stockholm newsroom, +46-8-700 1006 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011018dsat016nj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
