\par\par \b \uc2  Nordic  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2 : Sweden SEK Weaker Against DEM But Off Lows \b0\par\par\uc2 313 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Oktober 1996\par 17:13\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  STOCKHOLM (AP-Dow Jones)--The Swedish krona is weaker against a broadly firmer Deutsche mark late afternoon Tuesday, but the krona has come off day lows against the mark. \par \par \uc2  'The krona has followed the dollar and the lira against the mark,' said a trader with a Stockholm bank. \par \par \uc2  At 1600 GMT the mark is fetching 4.3370 kronor, down from 4.3415 kronor early in the morning in Europe, but up from 4.3280 kronor late Monday. \par \par \uc2  Earlier in the session, the krona's rapid weakening triggered an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by \b \highlight22\uc2 Sweden\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the Riksbank, to dampen volatility, dealers said. The Riksbank bought kronor against the mark at around the 4.35-krona-a-mark level, according to dealers. In line with its policy, the Riksbank refused to comment on \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  In the near term, dealers see the Deutsche mark trading in the interval of 4.3350 kronor and 4.3530 kronor. \par \par \uc2  Following are exchange rates for Nordic \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  at 1610 GMT Tuesday, compared with quotations from late afternoon Monday in Europe: \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par                   Deutsche mark      ECU Index\par Swedish SEK       4.3400   4.3280    112.75  112.61\par Danish DKK        3.8425   3.8355    -        -\par Norwegian NOK     4.2325   4.2242    101.87  101.71\par Finnish FIM       2.9945   2.9935    99.21   99.44\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Note: On October 14, when Finland entered its markka into Europe's\par exchange rate mechanism (ERM) the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's ECU reference index was\par also recalculated to reflect the markka's ERM entry level. An index\par reading of 100.00 now corresponds to the markka's parity level of\par 5.80661 FIM per ECU. The index moves inversely to the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's\par strength, i.e. a drop in the index level corresponds to an increase in\par the markka's external value.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 29-10-96\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1613GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1058 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011014dsat00hfo\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
