\par\par \b \uc2  Nordic  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2 : SEK Weaker Vs DEM; Riksbank  \highlight22\uc2 Intervenes \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 297 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Oktober 1996\par 14:14\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  OSLO (AP-Dow Jones)--The Swedish krona is a touch weaker against a broadly firmer Deutsche mark early afternoon Tuesday. Dealers say the krona followed other high-yielding \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  on a softening spurt. \par \par \uc2  At 1310 GMT the mark is fetching 4.3490 kronor, up 4.3415 kronor early in the morning in Europe and from 4.3280 kronor late Monday. \par \par \uc2  Stockholm dealers say the krona's rapid weakening triggered an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by \b \highlight22\uc2 Sweden\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the Riksbank, to dampen volatility. According to dealers, the Riksbank bought kronor against the mark at around the 4.35 kronor a mark level. \par \par \uc2  In line with normal practice, the Riksbank refused to comment on any \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . However, a few weeks ago, the Riksbank had made an official statement that it planned to make more active use of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  as a way of dampening volatility in the Swedish krona. And since that time the Riksbank has been seen in the market on several occasions, traders say. \par \par \uc2  Market players say the Riksbank isn't interested in seeing any particular level for the krona but favors instead low volatility. 'The Riksbank could let krona weaken to 4.40 kronor a mark, if it happens slowly enough,' one market player commented. \par \par \uc2  Underlying market sentiment remains strong for the Swedish unit, but traders warn it's been a long time since its weaker levels have been tested. 'It's going to be interesting to see how much softer the krona can go,' said one dealer with a major Stockholm bank. \par \par \uc2  In the near term he predicted the Swedish \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  would stick to a tight range between 4.3450 kronor a mark to 4.3550 kronor a mark. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 29-10-96 \par \par \uc2  1314GMT \par \par \uc2  1058 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011014dsat00gxc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
