\par\par \b \uc2  Nordic  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2 : SEK Steady Vs DEM; Mkt Eyes Further Gains \b0\par\par\uc2 295 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Oktober 1996\par 09:26\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  STOCKHOLM (AP-Dow Jones)--The Swedish krona is holding steady against the Deutsche mark in quiet trade early Tuesday as market players continue to eye the possibility of further krona strengthening. \par \par \uc2  At 0720 GMT, the Deutsche mark is at 4.3035 kronor only slightly down from the 4.3065 kronor it fetched late afternoon Monday in Europe. \par \par \uc2  'There's no change in the trend, we're still looking for a stronger krona,' said one Stockholm-based dealer adding that little commercial trade has been seen so far in the Swedish early session. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, though market participants are agreed the Riksbank, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Sweden\b0 \highlight\uc2 , entered the market late Monday they regard further \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Tuesday as 'unlikely.' \par \par \uc2  'The Riksbank sold krona to prevent it getting too strong in line with its stable-\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy. They probably won't re-enter the market today (Tuesday) unless we see mark weakeness in other European crosses,' said the trader. \par \par \uc2  'While we don't know the exact size of Monday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , there's talk of between 100 or 200 million marks worth,' he added. \par \par \uc2  Following are exchange rates for Nordic \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  at 0720 GMT Tuesday, compared with quotations from late afternoon Monday in Europe: \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par                   Deutsche mark      ECU Index\par Swedish SEK       4.3035   4.3065    111.81   111.84\par Danish DKK        3.8343   3.8342    -        -\par Norwegian NOK     4.2440   4.2457    102.09   102.11\par Finnish FIM       2.9865   2.9865     98.90   103.32\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Note: The weighted ECU index moves inversely to the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's\par strength, so that an increase represents a weakening of the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par The Danish krone isn't regularly quoted on a weighted ECU index.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 15-10-96\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0726GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1058 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011014dsaf0014d\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
