\par\par \b \uc2  Nordic  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2 : SEK Steady; Mkt Mulls Riksbank Statement \b0\par\par\uc2 279 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 September 1996\par 10:13\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  COPENHAGEN (AP-Dow Jones)--The Swedish krona is steady against the Deutsche mark early Thursday morning in Europe in quiet dealings, as market players taking a breather after a hectic, nervous session a day earlier. \par \par \uc2  At 0750 GMT, the Deutsche mark is at 4.3670 kronor, little changed from 4.3675 kronor late Wednesday afternoon in Europe, but up from Monday when it was at the 3.8430 kronor level. \par \par \uc2  'I'm hoping for a calm day after yesterday (Wednesday) which was very lively,' said a trader with a Stockholm bank Thursday. 'We've seen buying and selling at the 4.37 (kronor a mark) - but the amounts have been about the same so its hasn't moved the krona,' he added. \par \par \uc2  The Swedish market was thrown in a spin a day earlier when the Riksbank, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Sweden\b0 \highlight\uc2 , said it will increase the frequency of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in order to stabilize the Swedish krona and reduce its fluctuations. \par \par \uc2  Traders in Stockholm said the statement caused a wave of krona selling Wednesday because it raised uncertainty and caused some to speculate that the krona's recent strengthening trend may now be over. \par \par \uc2  However, having had a bit of time to chew over the Riksbank's statement, traders say it may be less worrying than initially thought. \par \par \uc2  'It's calmer now - let's see what the Riksbank actually does,' said one Malmoe trader, who added he sees the krona trading in a range of 4.3500 to 4.3750 kronor a mark in the near-term. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 26-09-96 \par \par \uc2  0813GMT \par \par \uc2  1058 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds9q07smy\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
