\par\par \b \uc2  Nordic  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2 : SEK Dips On Riksbank's New Strategy \b0\par\par\uc2 224 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 September 1996\par 15:38\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  STOCKHOLM (AP-Dow Jones)--The Swedish krona is weaker late afternoon Wednesday after the Riksbank, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Sweden\b0 \highlight\uc2 , said it will increase the frequency of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in order to stabilize the Swedish krona and reduce its fluctuations. \par \par \uc2  Traders in Stockholm said the statement caused a wave of krona selling because it raises uncertainty and caused some to speculate that the krona's recent strengthening trend may now be over. 'It's a knee-jerk reaction, and I expect the krona to rebound once the dust settles,' said one trader with a Stockholm bank. \par \par \uc2  At 1330 GMT, the Deutsche mark is at 4.3675 kronor in Stockholm, up from a day-low prior to the Riksbank's remarks of 4.3415 kronor and from 4.3530 kronor late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  As reported, Richard Groettheim, head of the Riksbank's department of monetary and and \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy, told AP-Dow Jones in a telephone interview that the Riksbank 'will both buy and sell \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  at a higher frequency' although he denied that the bank is aiming for any specific level for the krona. Rather, he said the ambition is to increase the krona's stability and to reduce its fluctuations. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 25-09-96 \par \par \uc2  1338GMT \par \par \uc2  1058 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds9p07q3c\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley1