\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Sweden \highlight\uc2  SEK Gains On Reported Riksbank  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 255 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 September 1995\par 16:06\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  STOCKHOLM (AP-DJ)--The Swedish krona turned higher Friday as the Swedish Riksbank, or \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , reportedly stepped into the market and bought kronor for Deutsche marks. \par \par \uc2  The Riksbank's buying helped push the Deutsche mark below 4.80 kronor in Stockholm and came after a general Deutsche mark weakening in European crosses. The timing of the move, one trader in Stockholm noted, confirmed the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's earlier statements that it may use \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to reinforce already positive market trends. \par \par \uc2  Since last Friday, when the Riksbank first announced it may use \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to bolster the krona, it has reportedly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on two occasions, on Tuesday and then again Friday. \par \par \uc2  At the Riksbank, officials declined to comment, in line with \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy. Some light may be shed on the extent of this week's Riksbank \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Monday, when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  releases its weekly foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves and \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  flow statistics. \par \par \uc2  Although the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  flow figure also includes certain interest rate payments and amortizations, it is viewed as an indication of the Riksbank's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets. \par \par \uc2  In late afternoon trading, the Deutsche mark is quoted at 4.7955 kronor in Stockholm, down from 4.8375 early on but up from a day low at 4.7815 kronor. On its ECU reference index, which trades inversely to the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's strength, the krona is measured at 122.59 from 122.93 a day earlier. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 15-09-95 \par \par \uc2  1406GMT \par \par \uc2  1058 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr9f07681\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (Sweden near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/1995 bis 21/08/2023\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\